BlastIRC original sound set

boom.ogg, rumble.ogg, blip.ogg, whoosh.ogg, pop.ogg, hush.ogg,
power_down.ogg, keytap.ogg, keytap_space.ogg, keytap_delete.ogg, and
keytap_delete_word.ogg were synthesized for BlastIRC by assets/generate-sfx.mjs.
They contain no samples, recordings, melodies, or other third-party material.

