tick.ogg        <- notification-message-in-soft.wav
click.ogg       <- notification-message-out-soft.wav
ding.ogg        <- notification-alert-soft.wav
tick_clear.ogg  <- notification-message-in-clear.wav
click_clear.ogg <- notification-message-out-clear.wav
ding_clear.ogg  <- notification-alert-clear.wav

Transcoded to Ogg Vorbis (ffmpeg -c:a libvorbis -q:a 5) without changing
the samples' level, duration, or channel layout.
